        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F93ADD, Addison Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditional design of Schlage's Addison handleset features a molded edged and square mounts. This product is just for looks. It does not lock or latch. It is most often used as a pull to match trim on the inactive side of a double door. It is crafted out of solid brass and features a very easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors and does not function. Does not latch or lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/addison-single-cylinder-handleset-schlage-f60add\"><b>Addison Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Addison Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Trim: Handlesets are solid forged brass; wrought brass trim rings with concealed security inserts.</li>\r\n<li>Inside Trim: are zinc-based plated to match finishes indicated.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit most standard door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Dummy Addison Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rage of Door Preparation: 4\" to 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Total Height: 18-1/8\" (with 5-1/2\" door prep)</li> \r\n<li>Exterior Total Projection: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Center to Center Grip Range: adjustable 8-3/8\" to 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Dummy Deadbolt Escutcheon Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Dummy Deadbolt Escutcheon Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Grip Escutcheon Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Height: 12-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SCH-ADD-hand-specification.pdf?v=1704262260\"><b>Schlage Addison Exterior Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
