                "title": "Addison Dummy Handleset, Schlage F93ADD",
                "description": "Addison Dummy Handleset Schalge F-ADD - The traditional design of Schlage's Addison handleset features a molded edged and square mounts. This product is just for looks. It does not lock or latch. It is most often used as a pull to match trim on the inactive side of a double door. It is crafted out of solid brass and features a very easy installation.",
